  m_text: "Reason for this game even happening:\nThank you stardance for making the
    stardance challenge\nits the reason why this game is even here right now.\n\nIdea
    for the game:\nHugo Virtanen (me)\n\nGraphic designing and 3D models:\nHugo Virtanen\n\nInspiration:\nBackrooms(not
    the movie)\n and liminal spaces\n\nSpecial thanks for support:\nThank you Silvonik
    for supporting\nme from the early days of LASTSIGNAL!\nif you liked this, go
    check out\nSilvonik's projects!\n\nAssistanse in one bug fix:\nSuklaasukkulaYT\n\nScripting:\nHugo
    Virtanen\n\nStoryline and characters:\nHugo Virtanen\n\n"
